        "text": "The half-truth of first-mover advantage, as Fernando Suarez and Gianvito Lanzolla argued in their 2005 Harvard Business Review article, is that being first is not a guarantee but a gamble \u2014 one whose payoff 'depends on the dynamics of the technology and the market you are entering.'",
